<title>USA: United Asset acquires Canadian firm.</title>
<headline>United Asset acquires Canadian firm.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Asset Management Corp said Wednesday that it completed the acquisition of J.R. Senecal &amp; Associates Investment Counsel, a Canadian institutional investment management firm based in Richmond Hill, Ontario, with C$6.0 billion (US$4.4 billion) in client assets.</p>
<p>The transaction brings UAM's international assets to $25 billion and its total assets to over $170 billion.  Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
